+// Kernel config buffer: the h7168 programs sit at its limit, and every inlined matmul_block /
+// matmul_block_init expands the dynamic-throttle re-init path on MATH and the address setup on
+// UNPACK. So every matmul call and init in this kernel goes through mm_init / mm_kloop below: one
+// out-of-line copy of each per TRISC.
